  "prefLabel": "Env-A 618.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2011-10-24",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 618.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to implement the nonattainment new source review (NSR) program as set forth in 171 through 193 of the Clean Air Act (Act) and the July 1, 2016 edition of 40 CFR §51.165.\n\nSource. #6057-B, eff 6-30-95; ss by #7879, eff 4-26-03 (formerly Env-A 622.02); ss by #9906, INTERIM, eff 4-26-11, EXPIRES: 10-24-11; ss by #10000, eff 10-1-11; ss by #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #12011, eff 10-22-16; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
